I'm doing some scaling/linking/equating. I fit a Graded Response Model
to one set of data and I'd like to use the estimates from this run as
fixed parameters in a Graded Response Model fit to a new set of data. So, I
would need to modify the data.frame from pars = 'values'. Is there a
straightforward way to modify this data.frame and input results from
coef()?

Kevin

